Hi,

one of the action items from the OpenPrinting Meeting in Tokyo was that 
the printer vendors will give feedback on the common printing dialog 
before the end of November.

Unfortunately, I did not get any answer yet.

Can you please review the common printing dialog (version 0.4) on

http://www.mmiworks.net/eng/publications/labels/openPrinting.html

so that we can do the draft specification as planned in Tokyo?

See the summary of the Tokyo meeting here:

https://www.linux-foundation.org/en/OpenPrinting/LFJapanSymposiumTokyo2007#Summary

Thanks in advance for your cooperation.

    Till
